<title>USA: Northeast Utilities Q4 loss on charge.</title>
<headline>Northeast Utilities Q4 loss on charge.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.60   profit	 $0.50</p>
<p> Net loss		  76,370   profit	64,226</p>
<p> Revs		     936,524		  980,430</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 128,343		  127,026</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.01   profit	 $2.24</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,831   profit     282,434</p>
<p> Revs		   3,792,148		3,750,560</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 127,960		  126,084</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 Q4 loss includes $63 million accounting reserve to help pay for 1997 nuclear expenditures.</p>
<p>1996 year net also includes $40 million reserve for nuclear expenditures taken against Q3 results.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
